OL,3,GNEWSAMan loses appeal against murder
OL,4,Aconviction of British soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was jailed for the murder of
OL,7,Fa British soldier in Londonderry more
OL,8,Fthan 40 years ago has had his appeal
OL,9,Fagainst his conviction dismissed.
OL,11,FJohn McDevitt, 61, claimed he was
OL,12,Fcoerced by police officers using
OL,13,Foppressive interview techniques into
OL,14,Fmaking a false confession to the
OL,15,Fkilling of Private Neil Clarke on
OL,16,FEaster Monday in 1984.
OL,18,FPte Clarke was killed after he exited a
OL,19,Fmilitary Land Rover that had been
OL,20,Fattacked with petrol bombs in the
OL,21,FBishop Street area of Derry.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
