OL,3,GNEWSAMan loses appeal against murder
OL,4,Aconviction of British soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe appeal, which was heard by Chief
OL,7,FJustice Siobhan Keegan, Justice Adrian
OL,8,FColton and Justice Stephen Fowler, was
OL,9,Frejected after the Court of Appeal in
OL,10,FBelfast found that it "must fail on its
OL,11,Ffacts."
